<title>UK: Norway Oseberg Oct loadings at equiv 43.2 cargoes.</title>
<headline>Norway Oseberg Oct loadings at equiv 43.2 cargoes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Oseberg crude liftings in October are scheduled to total the equivalent of 43.2 standard 500,000-barrel cargoes compared with 42.7 in the original September programme, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>October loadings should total 21.63 million barrels, compared with 21.33 million in September.</p>
<p>Traders expect the October programme to be made up of 17 cargoes of 600,000 barrels, 13 of 500,000 barrels, four of one million barrels and one of 930,000 barrels.</p>
<p>-- Mark Thompson, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
